#sortorder:9
#showas:离开他们的领地
This scenario features a twin pack of the territorial Zenith Architrave.  You'll be sporting the Zenith-themeed Onslaught fleet in an Octopus galaxy.  

A single AI, the Reservist, is more sensitive deep-striking than others so choose your planet captures carefully.  

The Architrave claim territory, and take great offense to long-term trespassers.  These are slightly weaker than usual, but they can still render the systems near them off-limits for permanent occupation.  There are hacking options to consider, as their ships have some exotic capabilities, but just working around them is also very viable.  